 illuminated traditional Chinese study with soft daylight filtering through the bamboo trees outside.\n\n[Shot 1] The camera is fixed at eye level facing the center of <Subject 6> near the wooden tea table. <Subject 1> (S1), the red-gold-haired young man with long red tassel earrings and royal blue draped outfit, steps forward from beside the bamboo screen toward the viewer, lowering his crossed arms as he approaches. He stops close to the lens, tilts his head slightly, looks directly at the camera with sharp amber eyes, and speaks using the clear voice timbre and cadence referenced from <Audio 1>, <d>[Chinese] 终于等到你了，欢迎来到我们的茶室。</d> He smiles slightly, gestures with a flick of his golden bracer-adorned wrist, and steps gracefully to the left side of the frame.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, <Subject 2> (S2), the red-haired woman in the cream knit shirt, walks forward from behind the calligraphy desk into the center foreground. Holding a porcelain teacup with both hands, she looks brightly into the camera with a warm expression and speaks in the voice timbre referenced from <Audio 1>, <d>[Chinese] 你好呀，快坐下尝尝刚泡好的新茶吧。</d> She nods warmly, takes a small sip, and steps to the right side of the frame.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:06.000, <Subject 3> (S3), the woman with the dark bun and white off-the-shoulder sweater, walks confidently forward toward the camera from the sunlit window background. She stops in front of the viewer, leans slightly forward with a playful smile, waving her hand close to the lens, and speaks in the same voice timbre referenced from <Audio 1>, <d>[Chinese] 嗨！今天天气真好，很高兴见到你哦！</d> She turns slightly and gestures toward the rest of the room before moving aside.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.000, <Subject 4> (S4), the young woman with cat ears and blue hair highlights in the white t-shirt, playfully hops forward into the close-up shot facing the viewer. She touches one of her cat ears, winks at the camera, and speaks in the voice timbre referenced from <Audio 1>, <d>[Chinese] 喵~ 终于轮到我打招呼啦，今天也要开心呀！</d> She makes a small paw-gesturing wave with her hand and steps back.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:12.000, <Subject 5> (S5), the woman with mauve-pink hair and glasses in the grey suit, adjusts her glasses with one hand while holding a blue notebook, stepping calmly into the center foreground. Looking elegantly into the camera with a gentle smile, she speaks in the refined voice timbre referenced from <Audio 1>, <d>[Chinese] 你好，大家都等候多时了，请随我们来吧。</d> She gracefully bows her head slightly, extends her arm toward the tea table, and all five characters briefly align in the background looking toward the camera as the frame freezes at 00:15.000.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nGentle breeze through bamboo leaves, peaceful indoor room tone with soft tea-pouring sounds continuing faintly in the background.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA soft, elegant traditional Chinese guqin and bamboo flute melody playing softly in the background."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "提示词，如果要ai扩写，请加一句帮我写提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [447.1349792480469, 511.2121276855469], "pos": [557.5162353515625, 251.31231689453125], "id": 84, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [{"name": "video_url", "label": "video_url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "video_url"}, {"name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["video/MiniMax_H3", "auto", "auto"], "inputs": [{"name": "video", "link": 72, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMBO", "locali